{"3736610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Paper Bleed", "steam_appid": 3736610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/cba8309d49c45313d7a51409a5e88429.poster.avif?t=1783528173\" width=800 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/cba8309d49c45313d7a51409a5e88429.webm?t=1783528173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/cba8309d49c45313d7a51409a5e88429.mp4?t=1783528173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Bleed is a creepy and grotesque point-and-click adventure, made with a raw art style and disturbingly gory hand-drawn animations. You find yourself in a horrible yet familiar place, facing your deepest fears and darkest thoughts. <strong><i>Nothing really dies here and you are all alone...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/74d23d21663617bea231475dd72273b4.poster.avif?t=1783528173\" width=800 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/74d23d21663617bea231475dd72273b4.webm?t=1783528173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/74d23d21663617bea231475dd72273b4.mp4?t=1783528173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</